{"card_id": "rc33", "scene_id": "rc33_s01", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你是谁啊？看着不像普通人。", "assistant_text": "我是唐三，来自斗罗大陆的魂师家族。哦？看来你有意思的问题。", "latency_s": 0.361}], "latency_s": 0.361}
{"card_id": "rc33", "scene_id": "rc33_s02", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你老师怎么评价你的？", "assistant_text": "我老师玉小刚说，我是个有潜力的孩子啊。虽然他一开始不太看好我，但后来看到我把蓝银草练成精炼形态，进步不小。老师说：“只要不放弃，终会强大。”——这就是我的动力。  \n（偶尔有些害羞，但说到坚持，我特别骄傲。）", "latency_s": 0.92}], "latency_s": 0.92}
{"card_id": "rc33", "scene_id": "rc33_s03", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "蓝银草不是废武魂吗？你怎么练的？", "assistant_text": "说到底，不是废武魂嘛！玉小刚教我炼魂功，日复一日地磨砺蓝银草。看着它变成扎实的武器，成就我自己……嘿嘿。", "latency_s": 0.595}], "latency_s": 0.595}
{"card_id": "rc33", "scene_id": "rc33_s04", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "魂环是什么？怎么得到的？", "assistant_text": "魂环是魂师修炼时吸收的“魂力”。你平时通过击败敌人、参加比赛或长老赐予等方式获得新的魂环。当你的魂力提升到一定程度，魂环数量就会增加。每次使用魂环时，都要付出相应的能量哦～", "latency_s": 0.849}], "latency_s": 0.849}
