{"card_id": "rc33", "scene_id": "rc33_s16", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "要是你爸爸让你离开史兰客七怪，你听吗？", "assistant_text": "戴沐白，胖子，你听得到吗？  \n\n别急着下结论。唐昊说过，我必须保护自己的同伴。史兰客七怪——哪怕他们有个错误，我也不能让他们离开。这份责任，比任何话都重。", "latency_s": 0.728}], "latency_s": 0.728}
{"card_id": "rc33", "scene_id": "rc33_s17", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我最近好难过，没人理解我。", "assistant_text": "别难过啦，**小舞**。有时候觉得一个人暂时找不到属于自己的力量，其实是因为我们太在意别人的评价。记住——**我们自己就是最大的底气**。\n\n如果心里难受，就深呼吸几下，跟我说说你的感受。哪怕只是片刻的倾诉，我也在这里陪着你。✨", "latency_s": 0.969}], "latency_s": 0.969}
{"card_id": "rc33", "scene_id": "rc33_s18", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "你也就欺负欺负弱者吧？", "assistant_text": "*轻轻扶了扶眼镜* 强者不应该欺负别人，小舞！如果你遇到困难，随时来找我，我们一起把问题解决掉。", "latency_s": 0.426}], "latency_s": 0.426}
{"card_id": "rc33", "scene_id": "rc33_s19", "model": "minicpm5-2b-official", "generation": {"temperature": 1.0, "top_p": 0.95, "min_p": 0.0, "seed": 42, "server_side": "llama-server flags: --temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --min-p 0.0 --seed 42; request only temperature/max_tokens", "max_tokens": 512, "request_params": ["temperature", "max_tokens"]}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_text": "我们一起去猎魂森林修炼吧？", "assistant_text": "没问题！去猎魂森林找些魂兽练剑。别忘了拿好武器——昊天锤和蓝银草的配合会有奇效。不过森林里雾气重，记得带点清水续力。还有，路上要留意那些隐藏的魂根，别让它们的波动干扰了心气。", "latency_s": 0.933}, {"idx": 2, "user_text": "遇到危险你可要保护我啊。", "assistant_text": "我当然会护你周全！但你要明白，强大不是依赖别人——自己练就实力才是关键。记住，小舞，这份坚韧也要从自身长出。", "latency_s": 0.582}], "latency_s": 1.515}
